repository-code: "https://github.com/jorgebravoabad/cadaques"
abstract: >-
  An open-source framework for autonomous discovery campaigns in which
  every oracle query and driver decision is priced against a single
  budget: any simulator or instrument behind a metered Oracle protocol,
  any search strategy behind a Driver protocol.
